{
  "about": [
    "Golden vectors for picking a new visitor's arm from the rules file (ember#309).",
    "bucket = big-endian u64 of the first 8 bytes of sha256(\"{user_id}:{experiment_id}\") modulo total_weight.",
    "Sort variants by id (lowercase UUID string order), clamp each weight below 0 to 0, sum to total_weight.",
    "The arm is the first variant whose cumulative weight exceeds bucket. total_weight 0 picks no arm: bucket and variant_id are null, and the client shows control.",
    "Pinned in ember by select_variant_deterministically (domain/services/sdk.rs)."
  ],
